verses.commentary:
13:8 "tell your son" The feast days of Israel (see
SPECIAL TOPIC: THE FEASTS OF ISRAEL) were meant to inform later generations of YHWH's great acts (cf. Exod. 12:26-27; 13:14;
10:2; Deut. 4:9-10; 5:29; 6:2,13,20-25; 11:19; 32:46). Parents were to pass on the faith to the next generation at home!
